        "original_id": "8b85b89a-9e57-53af-9220-716491318dbb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian Olsen, Frank Fertitta III, Lorenzo Fertitta\n- Organizations: WEC, Zuffa, UFC, Semaphore Entertainment Group, Station Casinos\n- Places: Las Vegas, Nevada\n- Concepts: WEC Heavyweight Championship, organizational acquisition, championship abolition\n\nFacts:\n- In January 2001, Zuffa was founded in Las Vegas, Nevada, by Station Casinos executives Frank Fertitta III and Lorenzo Fertitta.\n- In January 2001, Frank Fertitta III and Lorenzo Fertitta founded Zuffa to serve as the parent entity of the UFC after purchasing the UFC from Semaphore Entertainment Group.\n- Brian Olsen was the last WEC Heavyweight Champion before the title was abolished when Zuffa purchased the WEC organization.",
